e.com/ja/eula-reference/publishing-ja","text":"Unreal Engine はゲーム、シミュレーション、ビジュアライゼーションをデザインし制作するクリエイター向けの統合ツールスイートです。","image_url":"https://cdn2.unrealengine.com/ue-logo-1400x788-1400x788-8f185e1e3635.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"Unreal Engine","service_icon":"https://www.unrealengine.com/apple-touch-icon.png?v=5","from_url":"https://www.unrealengine.com/ja/eula-reference/publishing-ja","original_url":"https://www.unrealengine.com/ja/eula-reference/publishing-ja"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iAQEV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"00f27e4b-0033-45b6-945c-0fb6bdf40a9b","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ライセンスとしてロゴの表示を要求していたりは実はなかったりするんだろうか? 全然わからん…","ts":"1631637872.203200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/rs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fd92ffa8-3123-47dc-bde7-4634a739a293","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"\u0026gt; Unreal Engine End User License Agreement for Publishing（パブリッシング向けエンドユーザーライセンス契約）: このライセンスは、使用は無料、ただし、ゲームもしくはその他のインタラクティブな市販向け製品として収益化し、かつ、その製品による粗収入が 1,000,000 米ドルを超えた場合にのみ、5％ のロイヤリティを支払う義務が発生します。言い方を変えますと、ロイヤリティが 50,000 米ドル未満である場合は、Epic の負担となります！ロイヤリティの詳細についてはこのFAQの製品のリリースセクションをご覧ください。","ts":"1631637711.202200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ms+qT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"51af16ed-05c7-4827-8316-23c8956a20c3","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"スクエニがそこケチるとは思えんのだけど、実際どうなのかはわからんなぁ。調べればライセンス形態くらいはわかりそうだけど","ts":"1631637681.201900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WV0nC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dd58314f-f18a-41a6-b32e-1d81b73f5ff9","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"まぁ、企業がもっと高いライセンスを買えば表示しなくても済む可能性はありますね","ts":"1631637614.201200","edited":{"user":"U06ECBRTJ","ts":"1631637634.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ERB0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7c9b4293-ef4b-4ce2-a214-0ef9e42a2214","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"クレジット表示にでも載せておけばいいと思う","ts":"1631637586.200600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Cx7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a1732d66-fc36-4dc0-b0e0-ef81df1b4644","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"Unreal Engine なんかは KH3 とかだとやっぱり起動時にロゴが出ていたしそういうライセンスなのかな。このゲームが UE で作られてるかどうかなんて一部のオタクしか気にしないし一般ユーザーが知ったところで UE 側に利益があるとは思えんのだけどな","ts":"1631637493.199700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MfcM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ab474f16-f4fb-46d5-b162-0c4359be563e","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"無料だと強制的にロゴが出るけどまあこれは妥当","ts":"1631637403.198400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"U/h1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fcbc63b7-07bb-439b-b269-5bb2e36604b4","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"Unity は有償ライセンスならロゴは出さなくていいんですよね。えらい","ts":"1631637385.198000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"erai","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U01BY3SDBRS"]},{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]},{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"T3dI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"500be0f6-3807-458d-afa4-fb5a017c6c87","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"Unityみたいなのならともかく商用の物だと本当に縁がない","ts":"1631637348.197500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6lB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d6b78479-23c9-4705-b4d5-b1115380ec94","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"ユーザーにとってはどうでもいい情報だよねぇ","ts":"1631637311.196800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OXT3B"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a6b57593-8686-4a3e-b0e8-9978e77dde3e","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"サクナヒメのアンケートに答えている。\nこのゲームのいいところをいくつか書いているのだけど、その1つにタイトル画面が出るまでの速さがあると思っている。\n昨今の大型タイトルは大抵何かしらのミドルウェアを使っていて、そのライセンスに縛られて(だと思ってるけど本当かはどうかは知らない)タイトルの前にミドルウェアのロゴをいくつも表示しなくてはならず、なかなかゲームが始められない。ミドルウェアを使うことでユーザー体験を損なうというのは本末転倒でしかないので、ミドルウェア各社はロゴの表示要求についてもう少し見直してほしい…","ts":"1631637240.196200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]},{"name":"naruhodo","count":2,"users":["U013QL1RAPN","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+A/"}]}]
